  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Joint Technical Assistance LAIF-CIF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Contract stemming from Call for Proposals INTPA/2021/EA-RP/0003. JOINT TECHNICAL ASSISTANCE FOR THE LATIN AMERICA INVESTMENT FACILITY (LAIF) AND THE CARIBBEAN INVESTMENT FACILITY (CIF). This contract is to provide TA for monitoring, communication and programme management support. It feds from two different decisions, EUR1M from this one (41884) and the rest, EUR 1,461,325, from a LAIF decision (35750). &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;PCC-428006 goes together with INTV-24357 for which a primary intervention, logframe was created and reporting on the logframe is ongoing. Both relate to one contract with the Frankfurt school, which had to be split up in 2 contracts in CRIS as they were alimented by different decisions. Instead of having 2 logframes, which would also result in double reporting, it was decided to manage the results monitoring through INTV-24357. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
